<title>ITALY: Ansaldo to build substation in Malaysia.</title>
<headline>Ansaldo to build substation in Malaysia.</headline>
<dateline>GENOA, Italy 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's national electricity board, Tenaga National Berhad, has signed a 30 billion lire contract with Italy's Ansaldo for the supply of an electricity sub-station.</p>
<p>Ansaldo said in a note that the plant, 50 km from Kuala Lumpur, would provide back-up electricity supply to a new airport under construction if the main sub-station broke down.</p>
<p>Tenaga last year ordered four sub-stations from Ansaldo.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
